      "dateof": {
        "birth": "1944",
        "death": "1972"
      },
      "history": ""
    },
    "biography": "<p>@UUID[JournalEntry.OmK2qlPVNl758u6h]{Profile: August Krell}</p><blockquote><p><em>“He taught you to stop the blow. He taught me to take it.”</em></p></blockquote><table class=\"sbn-ficha\"><tbody><tr><th>Epithet</th><td>The Other Son</td></tr><tr><th>Concept</th><td>Antagonist; the false Vance</td></tr><tr><th>Clan</th><td>Brujah</td></tr><tr><th>Sect</th><td>none</td></tr><tr><th>Sire</th><td>Marcus “Ironjaw” Vance (PNJ-06)</td></tr><tr><th>Born</th><td>1944</td></tr><tr><th>Embraced</th><td>1972</td></tr><tr><th>Ambition</th><td>For someone to acknowledge that he was Vance&#39;s son too.</td></tr></tbody></table><h3>Demeanor</h3><p>Looks about twenty-eight, though he moves like an older man. Shaved head, a knife scar through his left eyebrow, a broken nose that healed badly; dark work clothes under Vance&#39;s coat. He&#39;s left-handed.</p><section class=\"sbn-combate\"><h3>August Krell · Combat Version</h3>\n<p><em>Full profile in Chapter 4.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Health</strong> 7 · <strong>Willpower</strong> 6 · <strong>Usual Hunger</strong> 2 · <strong>Blood Potency</strong> 3</p>\n<p><strong>Unarmed attack</strong> 10 (Strength + Brawl + Prowess). +2 superficial damage, or lethal against mortals (Lethal Body). <strong>With iron bar</strong> 8 (Strength + Melee), +2 damage.</p>\n<p><strong>Defense</strong> 8 (Dexterity + Athletics; 9 with Dexterity + Brawl). <em>Editor&#39;s Note: doc 14 said 7.</em> <strong>Initiative</strong> 7. <strong>Stealth</strong> 8. <strong>Escape</strong> 8, plus Blink.</p>\n<p><strong>Key combat powers:</strong> Prowess (+4 damage for one scene, costs Hunger), Blink (moves up to 50 meters in one turn), Soaring Leap (reaches rooftops), Daunt (mortals back away).</p>\n<p><strong>The inverted guard:</strong> against David or anyone with @UUID[JournalEntry.x7rVnQfKbb3HdbG5.JournalEntryPage.oGnroV6R68YdMQyD]{LOR-01 · The Doctrine of Controlled Fury} at level 4 or higher, −2 dice to melee defense.</p>\n<p><strong>Tactics:</strong> he strikes first, always in the same sequence (ribs, sternum, throat). If the fight lasts more than three turns, he leaves. He doesn&#39;t fight David head-on if he can avoid it. He doesn&#39;t kill mortals unless he has to. If he drops to half his Health, he flees toward the water.</p></section>",
    "appearance": "<p>Looks about twenty-eight, though he moves like an older man. Shaved head, a knife scar through his left eyebrow, a broken nose that healed badly; dark work clothes under Vance&#39;s coat. He&#39;s left-handed.</p>",
    "equipment": "<ul><li>Vance&#39;s coat: a long gray wool overcoat, tailored for a man broader in the shoulders (DOC-06, DOC-10)</li><li>Copy 2 of 3 of Vance&#39;s journals (DOC-04), with his pencil notes</li><li>Support from Halloway: an electric car with no registered plates, and two security ghouls (MEN-04) if he asks for them</li></ul>",
    "notes": "",
    "privatenotes": "<p>Editor&#39;s Note: doc 07 said “looks about thirty-five”; his age at the Embrace was settled on instead (about 28). Doc 07 gave him five powers with Potence 4 and four with Celerity 3; Spark of Rage (an amalgam that requires Presence 3; Krell has 2) and Rapid Reflexes (the Celerity power the adventure doesn&#39;t use) were removed, one per dot.</p><h3>Provisional (doc 16)</h3><ul><li>Krell is Vance&#39;s childe (David&#39;s blood brother).</li></ul>",
